OL,3,GNEWSAThousands without power as Storm
OL,4,ABoelo hits region
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of homes are without power,
OL,7,Fwith Storm Boelo bringing widespread
OL,8,Fdisruption across East Yorkshire and
OL,9,FLincolnshire this weekend.
OL,11,FBy 14:30 GMT, 13,943 properties in the
OL,12,Ftwo areas had been affected, with 5,757
OL,13,Fstill without electricity, said
OL,14,FNorthern Powergrid.
OL,16,FA yellow wind warning remains in place
OL,17,Funtil 21:00 GMT on Sunday.
OL,19,FSome roads were closed due to toppled
OL,20,Ftrees, according to Humberside Police.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
